<title>INDIA: Delhi shares end lower rail budget speculation.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares end lower rail budget speculation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares closed lower on Monday after early gains as speculators unloaded shares expecting a hike in railway freight rates in the railway budget scheduled to be presented laterthis week, brokers said.</p>
<p>The bourse's benchmark index closed 7.31 points lower at 718.55.</p>
